
<p><span class="catchln" id="secs_6-3_to_6-28">Secs. 6-3 to 6-28.</span> Sections <a href ="chap_077.htm#sec_6-3">6-3</a> to <a href ="chap_077.htm#sec_6-28">6-28</a>, inclusive, are repealed.</p>
<p class="source-first">(1949 Rev., S. 424-434, 436-448, 3617; 1949, 1955, S. 187d, 188d; November, 1955, S. N6; 1957, P.A. 5; 12; 25; 228; 307; 1959, P.A. 152, S. 99.)</p>
